# NAME: ParsecP2P-Port9000 (optional)
# AUTHOR: Horatio Xu
# FORMAT: Surge external RULE-SET (policy-less)
# RULES: 1
# OFFICIAL-REVIEW: 2026-11-13
# USE: Explicit opt-in only; assign DIRECT.
# REQUIRES: Surge iOS 5.8.4+ or Surge Mac 5.4.4+ for SRC-PORT.
# Requires Parsec Client Port 9000. Also matches unrelated UDP using source port 9000.
# SOURCE: https://manual.nssurge.com/rules/logical.html
# SOURCE: https://manual.nssurge.com/rules/source-and-port.html

AND,((SRC-PORT,9000),(PROTOCOL,UDP))
